        <ui:Label text="&lt;b&gt;VirtuaStick - USS Styles&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;color=#FFD700&gt;Test how your UI theme affects VirtuaStick.&lt;/color&gt;&#10;&#10;- Click the button to apply different &lt;b&gt;USS styles&lt;/b&gt;.&#10;- See how the visuals update in real-time.&#10;- Use this to preview integration with your game’s UI design.&#10;&#10;&lt;i&gt;No code changes required — fully USS driven.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;" name="Help" style="position: absolute; -unity-text-align: middle-left; font-size: 24px; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24); border-top-left-radius: 10px; border-top-right-radius: 10px; border-bottom-right-radius: 10px; border-bottom-left-radius: 10px; white-space: normal; flex-shrink: 1; width: 764px; align-self: flex-end; top: 0; flex-grow: 1; padding-top: 15px; padding-right: 15px; padding-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 15px; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" />
